==Trivia==
*De La Cospa may be a pun on ''[[wikipedia:Costa (surname)|Dalla Costa]]'' and コスパ ''kosupa'' (short for コストパフォーマンス ''kosuto pafōmansu'', [[wikipedia:Price–performance ratio|cost-performance]]).
*Resort De La Cospa appears to be based on the concept of a [[wikipedia:Tourist trap|tourist trap]]. Most of the stages are about underwhelming attractions or activities such as an [[After-Lunch Nap]] or [[Weedy Garden]], all culiminating in a [[Costly Emigration]]. The stages' Japanese names make this theme more apparent.
**The new enemy, [[Diabrollow]], is described as greedy, and tourist traps are often made out of greed.

